WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.400
Let’s walk through Tribe Street Journal.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.912
Read or prepare reporting with its source context intact.

00:00:05.912 --> 00:00:09.750
Distinguish observation, selected quote, scenario reporting, and

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.575
White Cell publication so participants can judge what kind of

00:00:12.575 --> 00:00:14.363
evidence they are receiving.

00:00:14.363 --> 00:00:18.100
On this slide, review published scenario reporting and observations

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.587
relevant to the team.

00:00:19.587 --> 00:00:22.500
In practice, use the journal as context;

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.925
it does not silently change an artifact.

00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:27.387
When you are ready, use Open Tribe Street Journal

00:00:27.387 --> 00:00:29.212
to move to the live surface.

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.385
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:32.385 --> 00:00:32.560
.
